      "instance_name": "child",
      "label": "a young boy",
      "description": "A young boy with light blonde hair and a wide, happy smile, wearing a blue t-shirt. He is standing outdoors, looking directly at the camera with a joyful expression, and has his hands clasped together near his chest. He is the central and most salient visual element in the image.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
